WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:21,140
Is it okay to remove the little rubberized clamps? And I assume you're talking about these things on the outside of your machine. This is the F-117. This is the F-122.

00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:30,140
Yes, you can. You could just unscrew those. These were these are to wrap the corner out if you're traveling makes it easier.

00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:41,140
Also, there used to be a hand held ground thing that you that would attach to that side on these units too. They don't use those anymore.

00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:47,140
But you could remove those. I've removed mine on the side of mine.

00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:50,140
So, yes, you can.

